(mount(2) requires CAP_SYS_ADMIN/root, so this is NOT auto-run in CI -)
(deliberately no .expected file, so test.sh skips it.)
(Run manually with: sudo ./target/release/vox tests/manual_mount_tmpfs.vox --run)

Remove the directory called '/tmp/vox_test_mount_tmpfs'.
Create a directory called '/tmp/vox_test_mount_tmpfs'.
On error print "mkdir failed", exit 1.

Mount "tmpfs" at "/tmp/vox_test_mount_tmpfs" with type "tmpfs".
On error print "tmpfs mount failed - are you root?", exit 1.
Print "tmpfs mount succeeded".

Unmount '/tmp/vox_test_mount_tmpfs'.
On error print "unmount failed", exit 1.
Print "unmount succeeded".

Remove the directory called '/tmp/vox_test_mount_tmpfs'.
On error print "rmdir failed", exit 1.
Print "cleanup complete".
